Your train metaphor completes it nicely.

The world is the terrain.

The track is causal structure.

The cars are state carried forward.

Stations are stable semantic states.

Switchyards are branching interpretations.

Signals are constraints.

Tickets are permissions/interfaces.

Passengers are observers.

Freight is information.

The engine is motive force.

The timetable is narrative sequence.

Callbacks are places you’ve already passed becoming relevant again.

